<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Feb ind output up 2.4pct m/m, 6.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Hungary Feb ind output up 2.4pct m/m, 6.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial output in February rose by 2.4 percent in month-on-month terms, and by 6.8 percent year-on-year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Friday.</p>
</text>
